<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Dutch first</p>
<p>division play-off matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p> Cambuur Leeuwarden (II)	 0  NEC Nijmegen	4</p>
<p> Go Ahead Eagles Deventer (II) 5  VVV Venlo (II)    1</p>
<p>    Final standings	   P   W   D   L   F   A Pts</p>
<p> NEC Nijmegen		   6   5   0   1  19   5  15</p>
<p> Go Ahead Eagles Deventer   6   5   0   1  17   8  15</p>
<p> Cambuur Leeuwarden	   6   2   0   4   8  15   6</p>
<p> VVV Venlo			6   0   0   6   6  22   0</p>
<p>Group winners, NEC Nijmegen, will remain in the Dutch first</p>
<p>division next season.</p>
</text>
